                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}&=\\frac16k(k+1)(2k+7)+(k+1)(k+3)\\\\&=(k+1)\\left(\\frac16k(2k+7)+k+3\\right)\\\\&=\\frac16(k+1)\\left(k(2k+7)+6k+18\\right)\\\\&=\\frac16(k+1)(2k^2+7k+6k+18)\\\\&=\\frac16(k+1)(2k^2+13k+18)\\\\&=\\frac16(k+1)(k+2)(2k+9)\\\\&=RHS.\\end{aligned}",
